Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.34,0:00:02.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm a little upset.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我有点郁闷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.42,0:00:03.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I have two of these now.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这种奖杯 我已有两座
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.76,0:00:05.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I wanted the bigger one, but that's okay.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我想要更大的 不过没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:07.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's still a pretty trophy.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个奖杯也很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.71,0:00:11.20,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年 她也拿过辛辛那提亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:13.53,TL,,0,0,0,,今年两座冠军 {\fs78}3{\fs68}次亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.53,0:00:16.49,TL,,0,0,0,,佩古拉也经历过法网首轮出局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:20.04,TL,,0,0,0,,她的这张年终门票 要从一月说起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.51,0:00:24.00,TL,,0,0,0,,布里斯班打进{\fs78}4{\fs68}强 澳网也进{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.05,TL,,0,0,0,,墨尔本 她连胜凯斯和阿尼西莫娃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.05,0:00:29.89,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛两盘负于莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.84,0:00:39.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Makes no mistake of it this time,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一次她没有再失手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:42.72,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and it's Elena Rybakina{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.72,0:00:47.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}moving into the Australian Open final of 2026.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N闯进{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年澳网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:49.41,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}月来到迪拜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:51.12,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛先丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:54.07,TL,,0,0,0,,她连追两盘击败阿尼西莫娃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:57.42,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}战胜斯维托丽娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.42,0:00:59.55,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到本赛季第一冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.39,0:01:05.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is a dream debut Dubai title{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N梦幻般的迪拜首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:07.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for Jessica Pegula,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N属于杰西卡 佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:11.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and she seals it in style with an ace.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她用一记{\fs78}ACE{\fs68}漂亮收官
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.10,0:01:13.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But just super happy{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但我特别开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:14.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to go home with a trophy.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N能带着奖杯回家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:17.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was just, it was a great week.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一周真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.76,0:01:19.80,TL,,0,0,0,,印第安维尔斯 迈阿密
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.80,0:01:23.45,TL,,0,0,0,,她都止步{\fs78}8{\fs68}强 两次负于莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.26,0:01:25.41,TL,,0,0,0,,到了查尔斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:28.41,TL,,0,0,0,,她连打{\fs78}4{\fs68}场{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘 撑进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.41,0:01:29.56,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.56,0:01:32.10,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}击败斯塔罗杜布采娃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.10,0:01:34.29,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到本赛季第二冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.57,0:02:02.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's truly world-class from Pegula.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N佩古拉这球真是世界级水准
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.71,0:02:07.21,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The difference between 30-all and 15-40.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这分决定三十平还是十五比四十
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.65,0:02:09.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She saved the match points.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对手此前救下那些冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.69,0:02:12.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And now a fourth championship point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在来到第四个冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.85,0:02:16.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a week!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多么精彩的一周
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.25,0:02:22.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The defending champion claims the title again in Charleston.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N卫冕冠军再度称霸查尔斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.53,0:02:27.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And no one has won more matches this year{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N论本赛季{\fs78}WTA{\fs68}胜场数
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.09,0:02:30.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}on the WTA Tour than Jess Pegula.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N还无人超过佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.70,0:02:34.27,TL,,0,0,0,,马德里第三轮出局 罗马止步{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:37.23,TL,,0,0,0,,到了法网 先以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.23,0:02:40.73,TL,,0,0,0,,她却被比勒尔连追两盘 首轮出局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:03.05,TL,,0,0,0,,草地赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.05,0:03:05.31,TL,,0,0,0,,她在柏林半决赛的决胜盘送
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.31,0:03:07.52,TL,,0,0,0,,给萨巴伦卡一个{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:10.79,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛负于诺斯科娃 取得亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:24.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Jessica Pegula, the 2024 winner in Berlin, is into another final,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年冠军佩古拉再进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.25,0:03:31.17,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as she takes out the world number one, Aryna Sabalenka.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她击败了世界第一萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.50,0:03:33.27,TL,,0,0,0,,温网 她先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:36.49,TL,,0,0,0,,仍被高芙逆转 止步{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:53.27,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And once again, Coco is the comeback queen.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又一次 高芙成为逆转女王
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:56.61,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Four six, six three, six three.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N四比六 六比三 六比三
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.04,0:04:05.54,TL,,0,0,0,,华盛顿亚军 多伦多止步第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:08.00,TL,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提 她连赢{\fs78}3{\fs68}场{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.00,0:04:09.58,TL,,0,0,0,,今年第五次进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.58,0:04:11.83,TL,,0,0,0,,最终又输给高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:19.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She needs the first only.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她只用一个赛点就兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.79,0:04:23.19,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Jessica Pegula, for the second time in her career,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N佩古拉职业生涯第二次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.19,0:04:25.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}will feature in the final here in Cincy.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N打进辛辛那提决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.77,0:04:39.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is the first title of the year for Coco Gauff.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是高芙今年的首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.69,0:04:41.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is her second in Cincinnati,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她第二次在辛辛那提夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.61,0:04:47.27,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and it is the 12th singles title of her tremendous career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也是她生涯第十二座单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:52.44,TL,,0,0,0,,美网 她逆转费尔南德斯和纳瓦罗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.44,0:04:55.11,TL,,0,0,0,,今年第二次拿到大满贯{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.11,0:04:56.49,TL,,0,0,0,,赢下纳瓦罗后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.49,0:04:59.19,TL,,0,0,0,,她谈到那些消极的念头
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:30.99,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She got through it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她挺过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:41.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's in the semis at her favorite tournament.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她在最爱的赛事打进四强
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:44.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think I do a great job of having a short-term memory,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我很擅长不纠结刚发生的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.65,0:05:47.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}so I know that every time I come out, no matter what,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N所以每次上场 无论如何
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.23,0:05:50.59,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I just have to tell all the negative me{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我得对那个消极的自己说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.59,0:05:52.17,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to shut up and just play tennis{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N闭嘴 继续打网球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.17,0:05:53.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and compete and battle{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N去竞争 去战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:56.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and think out there and try and problem-solve as best I can.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N动脑筋 尽全力解决问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:05:59.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And yeah, that's all I'm trying to do, really.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对 我努力做的就是这些
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:06:03.00,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}负于萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:05.34,TL,,0,0,0,,今年大满贯最好成绩是{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:07.74,TL,,0,0,0,,分别在澳网和美网
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:17.59,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what a save!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哦 救得真漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:28.40,TL,,0,0,0,,美网之后 她退出新加坡和北京
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.40,0:06:30.79,TL,,0,0,0,,武汉首战 {\fs78}3{\fs68}个赛点未兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.79,0:06:33.23,TL,,0,0,0,,仍被奥斯塔彭科逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:37.78,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}14{\fs68}日 {\fs78}WTA{\fs68}正式确认她连续
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.78,0:06:39.64,TL,,0,0,0,,第五年入围年终
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.64,0:06:41.55,TL,,0,0,0,,门票来自一整年的积累
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.55,0:06:42.90,TL,,0,0,0,,武汉这一场失利
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:45.37,TL,,0,0,0,,也留在她的赛季记录里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:48.88,TL,,0,0,0,,此后 她又退出宁波
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:51.65,TL,,0,0,0,,连续第五年走进年终 这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.65,0:06:54.05,TL,,0,0,0,,你期待她走到哪一步？
